# Proof that a tiering of a loaded rule file conserves it; code only, its selftest sandboxes never. @es
# Prueba de que un escalonado de un fichero de reglas cargado lo conserva; solo código, nunca sus sandboxes.
!/rule-tiering/
!/rule-tiering/*.mjs
/rule-tiering/scratch/
/delegation-receipts/scratch/

# Shared modules the global guards import, vendored byte-identical from b100-am-ui (vendored/PROVENANCE.json).
!/vendored/
!/vendored/**
/vendored/state/
